<h1>ModigPreparePages_TOUCH_TRAINING
</h1>

<h2><a name="_name"></a>PURPOSE <a href="#_top"><img alt="^" border="0" src="../../../../up.png"></a></h2>
<div class="box"><strong>cb = ModigPreparePages_TOUCH_TRAINING</strong></div>

<h2><a name="_synopsis"></a>SYNOPSIS <a href="#_top"><img alt="^" border="0" src="../../../../up.png"></a></h2>
<div class="box"><strong>function cb = ModigPreparePages_TOUCH_TRAINING </strong></div>

<h2><a name="_description"></a>DESCRIPTION <a href="#_top"><img alt="^" border="0" src="../../../../up.png"></a></h2>
<div class="fragment"><pre class="comment">  cb = ModigPreparePages_TOUCH_TRAINING

 page 1: grey background
 page 2: touch target
 page 3: target touched feedback
 page 4: black background

 See also drawRectangle_RBM, drawImages, <a href="ModigPrepareTrial_TOUCH_TRAINING.html" class="code" title="function runned = ModigPrepareTrial_TOUCH_TRAINING">ModigPrepareTrial_TOUCH_TRAINING</a>
 rbm 6.11 streamlined coding
 RBM 01.08</pre></div>

